   "source": [
    "#### Epoching parameters\n",
    "Epochs were extracted from -200 ms to 800 ms relative to the onset of the target word, and baseline-corrected using the -200 ms to 0 ms interval. Epochs were created for related and unrelated conditions. Epochs exceeding 150 μV in the EEG channels or 250 μV in the EOG channels were rejected. The N400 was quantified at electrode CPz using a measurement window of 300 to 500 ms after target onset. Artifacts were rejected using fixed amplitude thresholds.\n"
   ]
